<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Seawolf #1, Ivan Marches, 1996</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;NEWS&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;“After months of economic, ethnic, and political disturbances in the former Soviet Union, Russian military readers suceded in overthrowing the pro-democracy government and establishing a nationalist military regime. Opposition to the coup quickly disappeared when, three days ago, the Russian President disappeared under the mysterious circumstances. Russian troops are now consolidating the coup’s control of all major cities and industries. Armored divisions have occupied &lt;?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;Latvia&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;, &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;Lithuania&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;, and &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;Estonia&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;, forcibly reincorporating the Baltic states into the resurrected &lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Soviet Union&lt;/st1:place&gt;. Organized resistance to the invasion has been met with brutality and violence.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;“NATO has responded to the recent events with a general mobilization along the German border and continual airlifts of supplies to &lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Europe&lt;/st1:place&gt;. NATO and US forces worldwide are on the highest level of alert.”&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;“Closer to home, a revolt has broken out in &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Cuba&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;, Anti and pro-Castro forces are battling across the island tonight. Sources say the &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;U.S.&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; is now supplying arms and supplies to the rebels, but the President has ruled out direct military intervention. The Cuban navy and most of the air force have remained loyal to Castro, but approximately half of the army is believed to be on the rebel side. Unconfirmed reports indicated that Soviet advisors stationed in &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Cuba&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; have joined the fighting&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;On Castros’s behalf.”&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;“Sources within the Pentagon report that a large force of Soviet vessels has left the northern &lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:PlaceType w:st="on"&gt;port&lt;/st1:PlaceType&gt; of &lt;st1:PlaceName w:st="on"&gt;Severomorsk&lt;/st1:PlaceName&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;. The task force is allegedly carrying troops to relieve Castro’s beleaguered forces. Neither the State Department nor the Pentagon has had any official comment on the rumors.”&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;BACKGROUND&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;A Russian task force has sailed from Severomorsk, escorting troop transports carrying 12,000 marines and soldiers to bolster pro-Castro forces in &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Cuba&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;. Increasingly stern warnings from &lt;st1:State w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Washington&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:State&gt; have been ignored. The Seawolf has been sent to determine if any missile submarines are secretly accompanying the group. Your task is to identify any boomers, avoiding contact at all costs. Under no conditions is the Seawolf to initiate hostilities.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Scenario title and texts original from game SSN21 Seawolf &lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;by John W. Ratcliff (Electronics Arts 1994), All rights reserved&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;Author of Command scenario – Miguel Molina “Meroka37”&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;NOTE: Le the scenario run for 1 second before start to give orders to units.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
